# requires: saves
# Two game controllers (docs/GAMEPLAY_TESTING.md "pad N"): Demir at the mosque (cam1, kayit1.sav), original controller mode.
# Pad 1 is Input slot 1 only: its d-pad up and full stick never walk (Engine::legacyPad 0). Pad 0's d-pad up is the Up arrow
# (engine.cpp core_gamepad_key) and walks, as with a single pad.
realtime off
load-save 1
wait until LY_AktifLevelID == 7 && level_yuklendi_ok == 1 && player != 0 && oyuncu_pasif == 0 && oyun_ilk_basladi == 0 && EnvaterAcilabilirmi == 1 timeout 7200
frames 60
store x0 player.x
store y0 player.y
pad 1 down dpup
pad 1 axis lefty -1
frames 120
assert $pad(1) == 1 && $pad(1,dpup) == 1 && $pad(1,lefty) == -1 && $pad(0,dpup) == 0 && $pad(0,lefty) == 0
assert player.x == @x0 && player.y == @y0
pad 1 up dpup
pad 1 axis lefty 0
frames 10
pad 0 down dpup
wait until player.x != @x0 || player.y != @y0 timeout 120
assert $pad(0,dpup) == 1 && $pad(1,dpup) == 0
pad 0 up dpup
frames 10
